<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Quick-Bets UI Mockup</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #fafaf9;
            color: #1c1917;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 414px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }
        .header {
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .demo-info {
            background: #fef7ed;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .demo-info h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #f59e0b;
        }
        .demo-info p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .button {
            background: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background: #d97706;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .button.secondary {
            background: #3b82f6;
        }
        .button.secondary:hover {
            background: #2563eb;
        }
        .screens {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .screen-card {
            background: #fafaf9;
            border: 1px solid #e7e5e4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .screen-card:hover {
            border-color: #f59e0b;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .screen-card h4 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #1c1917;
        }
        .screen-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #78716c;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .status {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 8px;
        }
        .status.success {
            background: #dcfce7;
            color: #166534;
        }
        .status.info {
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
        }
        .info-section {
            background: #f0f9ff;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        .info-section h4 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #0c4a6e;
        }
        .info-section p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #075985;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🚀 Quick-Bets UI Mockup</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="demo-info">
                <h3>🎨 UI Mockup Complete</h3>
                <p>
                    This is a complete UI mockup for the Quick-Bets private bet resolution tool.
                    All screens are implemented with beautiful animations, mobile-first design,
                    and the exact functionality you specified.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <h4>✨ Key Features Implemented</h4>
                <p>
                    • Landing page with wallet login<br>
                    • Main screen with bet management<br>
                    • Bet details with action buttons<br>
                    • Create bet with URL generation<br>
                    • Accept bet with security warnings<br>
                    • Multi-asset support (STX/sBTC/BTC)<br>
                    • Smooth animations throughout<br>
                    • Mobile-first responsive design
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <h4>🎯 Design System</h4>
                <p>
                    • Stacks/Hiro inspired colors (Bitcoin orange, Stacks blue)<br>
                    • Inter font family for clean typography<br>
                    • Smooth 300ms animations<br>
                    • Mobile-optimized for 390×844 viewport<br>
                    • No Tailwind or purple - custom design system
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <h4>🔧 Technical Implementation</h4>
                <p>
                    • React Native with TypeScript<br>
                    • Complete component library<br>
                    • Mock data services for all interactions<br>
                    • Invisible asset conversion logic<br>
                    • URL-based proposal system<br>
                    • Mutual consent resolution flows
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="screens">
                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>📱 Landing Screen</h4>
                    <p>Hero section, feature cards, wallet login</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>

                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>🏠 Main Screen</h4>
                    <p>Active bets, results, notifications</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>

                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>📋 Bet Details</h4>
                    <p>Full bet info, action buttons, resolution</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>

                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>✏️ Create Bet</h4>
                    <p>Terms input, URL generation, preview</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>

                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>✅ Accept Bet</h4>
                    <p>Security warnings, funding, acceptance</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>

                <div class="screen-card">
                    <h4>🎨 Animations</h4>
                    <p>Smooth transitions, fireworks, effects</p>
                    <span class="status success">✅ Complete</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <h4>🚀 Ready for Testing</h4>
                <p>
                    The UI mockup is complete and ready for your review! All screens are
                    implemented with realistic mock data, smooth animations, and the exact
                    UX flows you specified. The design captures the Stacks/Hiro aesthetic
                    while being unique to Quick-Bets.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
                <h3 style="color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 16px;">🎉 All Screens Complete!</h3>
                <p style="color: #78716c; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Ready for your UX review and iteration
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Add some interactive elements
        document.querySelectorAll('.screen-card').forEach(card => {
            card.addEventListener('click', () => {
                card.style.transform = 'translateY(-2px)';
                setTimeout(() => {
                    card.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
                }, 200);
            });
        });

        document.querySelectorAll('.button').forEach(button => {
            button.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                e.preventDefault();
                button.style.transform = 'scale(0.95)';
                setTimeout(() => {
                    button.style.transform = 'scale(1)';
                }, 100);
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
